  </div>

  <div class="section-hdr"><h2>⚡ Agent Version Performance</h2><span class="sh-note">v2 launched 28/03/2026 — lead creation logic changed, volume not comparable across versions</span></div>
  <div class="version-grid">
    <div class="version-card" style="--vc-accent:#3b82f6">
      <div class="vc-tag" style="background:rgba(59,130,246,0.12);color:#60a5fa;border:1px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.2)">Agent v1 · May 2025 → Feb 2026</div>
      <div class="vc-period">Lead created at basket validation — committed buyers only</div>
      <div class="vc-metrics">
        <div class="vc-m"><div class="vc-m-val" style="color:#60a5fa">53.6%</div><div class="vc-m-lbl">Avg close rate</div></div>
